    "detailed_description": "<strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> is a game where you talk your way out of sticky situations. Literally.<br><br>Fool NPCs powered by state-of-the-art AI. Play with your voice.<br><br>Talk to Me Human is a new kind of game where you:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Encounter</strong> \u2014 Find yourself in unexpected, awkward, and humorous scenarios.<br></li><li> <strong>Explain</strong> \u2014 Lie, misdirect, compliment, coerce \u2014 the choices are endless. Speak out loud!<br></li><li> <strong>Receive Judgment</strong> \u2014 The AI decides if you pass or fail. You can always try again!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Talk to Me Human</strong> is a game where you talk your way out of sticky situations. Literally.<br><br>Fool NPCs powered by state-of-the-art AI. Play with your voice.<br><br>Talk to Me Human is a new kind of game where you:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Encounter</strong> \u2014 Find yourself in unexpected, awkward, and humorous scenarios.<br></li><li> <strong>Explain</strong> \u2014 Lie, misdirect, compliment, coerce \u2014 the choices are endless. Speak out loud!<br></li><li> <strong>Receive Judgment</strong> \u2014 The AI decides if you pass or fail. You can always try again!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Talk your way out of sticky situations. Literally. In this light-hearted adventure, play with your voice to lie, compliment, and coerce your way through everyday awkward challenges. Earn Social Currency, and save your cat. The catch? NPCs are all state-of-the-art AIs who aren't so easily fooled.",
